    "media_with_text_MBXhpQ": {
      "type": "media-with-text",
      "blocks": {
        "heading_nNWBya": {
          "type": "heading",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Portable Breast Pumps",
            "heading_size": "h3",
            "heading_h1": false
          }
        },
        "text_JmCMib": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>For moms on the move, Ameda’s portable breast pumps are lightweight and easy to carry, with battery options that allow for pumping anytime, anywhere. These pumps offer the flexibility to keep up with your busy lifestyle, making it easier to balance breastfeeding with work, travel, and other activities. Ameda’s portable pumps are designed for convenience, featuring compact size and battery-powered operation, so you can pump whenever and wherever you need to. Whether you’re traveling, at the office, or simply out and about, our portable pumps provide the freedom and flexibility to maintain your milk supply without being tied to an outlet. With features like easy-to-clean parts and discreet carrying cases, Ameda’s portable pumps are perfect for moms who need a versatile pumping solution. Wearable breast pumps offer an additional discreet, hands-free option that can be worn inside a regular bra, making them ideal for use during commutes or while engaging in daily activities.</p>",
            "enlarge_text": false
          }
        }
      },
