    "media_with_text_QUfFa6": {
      "type": "media-with-text",
      "blocks": {
        "heading_MgQgny": {
          "type": "heading",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Hospital Grade Breast Pumps",
            "heading_size": "h3",
            "heading_h1": false
          }
        },
        "text_8h4ebQ": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>Ameda's hospital-grade breast pumps are designed for multi-user environments, providing the highest level of efficiency and comfort. Hospital-grade pumps are ideal for moms who need extra support in establishing or maintaining their milk supply, especially in challenging situations like premature births or breastfeeding difficulties. Hospital-grade pumps are known for their powerful suction and consistent performance, which can make a significant difference in helping moms successfully express milk. Available for rent through insurance, these pumps offer the strength and reliability needed for effective milk expression, particularly for moms facing unique challenges. Ameda's hospital-grade pumps feature advanced technology that closely mimics an infant's natural nursing pattern, promoting optimal milk flow and comfort. Whether you're in a hospital setting or at home, our hospital-grade pumps provide the robust support you need to achieve your breastfeeding goals.</p>",
            "enlarge_text": false
          }
        }
      },
